=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  - Data sources: web `useTranslation` + `useStartImpersonation` (the mutation the
    component itself fires) + the parent gate `useImpersonationStatus`/`useImpersonation`
    (web comment: "Hidden in open-mode installs … gate render on
    useImpersonationStatus().data?.mode !== 'open'"). All bound through P1/S8 seams:
      • ImpersonationStarting  → web startMut.mutate({ subject }); no HTTP in the view.
      • ImpersonationStatusProviding → the gate/freshness status; no HTTP in the view.
  - Composition (web ghost Button + ConfirmDialog):
      • Button   -> TSButton(variant:.ghost, size:.small, isLoading:phase==.starting)
                    + person.badge.key.fill glyph (web lucide `UserCog`); label is the
                    web ternary isPending?"Starting…":"Impersonate"; disabled mirrors
                    web `disabled || isPending` (extended with gate + offline); carries
                    accessibilityIdentifier "user-impersonate-button-<subject>"
                    (web data-testid) + aria-label "Impersonate <subject>".
      • ConfirmDialog -> native .alert (warning): title "Start impersonation session?",
                    message "You will see TeslaSync as <subject> for up to 15 minutes…",
                    confirm "Start impersonation", cancel "Cancel"; onConfirm closes +
                    fires the start seam (web handleConfirm).
  - States (ALL rendered, each with a #if DEBUG preview + a model/adapter unit test):
      loading (skeleton) · empty (open-mode → friendly "disabled in open-access mode"
      note; web hides, native explains, never a blank box) · error (status failed →
      message + Retry) · stale (freshness chip + "Status may be out of date" banner,
      time-based) · offline (last-known status kept + "Offline" chip/banner) · idle
      (enabled button) · confirming (alert) · starting (spinner + "Starting…") ·
      disabled (parent / already-active greyed button + note) · started (success pill,
      web global ImpersonationBanner driver) · start-failed (inline error + Retry).
  - i18n (P1/S10): web keys preserved VERBATIM — impersonation.button.{aria,starting,
    start} + impersonation.confirm.{title,message,confirm,cancel}; web i18next
    `{{subject}}` expressed natively as `%@` (String(format:)). Native chrome
    namespaced impersonation.{freshness,status,unavailable,banner,start,action}.*.
    Every code-referenced key is declared in UserImpersonateButton.strings; NO English
    string literals in native code (all via UserImpersonateButtonStrings + Text(verbatim:)).
  - Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on the action button (interpolated subject) + every
    chip/note/banner/pill; testid via accessibilityIdentifier; Dynamic-Type system
    fonts (Font.TS); reduce-motion honored (TSSkeleton shimmer).
  - Telemetry (P1/S11): UserImpersonateButtonModel.start() emits view.opened with surface
